        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WB238 2-3/8\" Concave Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 2-3/8\" round flush wall mounted door bumper (door stop) is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. \r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WB238U-specifications.gif?v=1704354559\" width\"299\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" atl=\"2-3/8 Inch Concave Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese decorative wall mounted door bumpers are  used everywhere  from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. Anywhere you need to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Deltana WB238 2-3/8 Inch Wall Bumper\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Screw Mounting</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 8</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WB238.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  WB238 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 2-3/8 Inch Concave Door Bumper, Deltana WB238",
                "description": "Deltana WB238 - Solid Brass Concave Flush Bumper is 2 3/8 in Diameter. These solid brass bumpers are screwed to the wall for protection (of the wall and door) when a door is fully opened. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\nAvailable in 8 different finishes.",
                "keywords": "DEL-WB238 2 3/8 Inch Concave Wall Door Stops, Deltana WB238 Solid Brass 2-3/8 Inch Concave Flush Bumpers, flush door bumpers,  2-3/8  inch Concave wall stops, 2 3/8  inch diameter wall mounted door stops, wood door bumpers, wood door stops, steel door bumpers, steel door stops, doorstops, door dampers, rubber door stops, doorstoppers, door stoppers,  wooden door stops, Deltana door stops, Deltana WB238 2-3/8 Inch Wall Bumpers,"
